#module "tui"
'' std/tui: tui -- FB's terminal UI module, umbrella header
''
''     #import "std/tui"
''     using tui
''
'' C:\dev\docs\tui\README.md is the index; each header names its RFC.
''
'' Mirrors fb/logging.bi: one include that pulls the module in, so a caller does
'' not have to know which type lives in which file.
''
'' PHASE 1 ships the value layer, the backend and the renderer:
''
''     tuicore.bi     RFC-0001   TuiRect, TuiColor, TuiStyle, the SGR encoder
''     tuiterm.bi     RFC-0002   TuiTerminal -- raw mode, capabilities, restore
''     tuibuffer.bi   RFC-0003   TuiCell, TuiBuffer, TuiFrame, TuiScreen, the diff
''
'' PHASE 2 adds input, PHASE 3 the column-width table:
''
''     tuiinput.bi    RFC-0004   TuiEvent, the VT grammar, TuiInput, PollEvent
''     tuiwidth.bi    RFC-0005   TuiCharWidth, TuiStringWidth, TuiTruncate, TuiWrap
''     tuiwidthtab.bi            GENERATED from the UCD -- do not edit by hand
''
'' PHASE 4 adds layout:
''
''     tuilayout.bi   RFC-0006   TuiConstraint, TuiSplitH/V, padding, centring
''
'' PHASE 5 adds widgets:
''
''     tuiwidget.bi   RFC-0007   TuiWidget, TuiFocusRing, TuiButton/TuiButtonOf, TuiStack
''     tuiwidgets.bi  RFC-0008   Block, Paragraph, List, Table, Tabs, Gauge, Spinner, Scrollbar
''
'' PHASE 6 adds charts:
''
''     tuidraw.bi     RFC-0008   TuiCanvas (braille), TuiGraph, TuiSparkline,
''                               TuiBarChart, TuiMeter
''
'' PHASE 7 adds input widgets and overlays:
''
''     tuiform.bi     RFC-0008   TextInput, TextArea, Checkbox, RadioGroup, Select
''     tuichrome.bi   RFC-0008   Popup, MessageBox, MenuBar, StatusBar, Tree
''
'' PHASE 8 adds the application loop:
''
''     tuiapp.bi      RFC-0009   TuiApp, TuiCmd, TuiRun, TuiRenderOnce
''
'' The module is complete.
''
'' ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
'' ONE RULE BEFORE ANY OTHER
''
'' Inside a TUI session, DO NOT USE PRINT, LOCATE, COLOR, CLS, INKEY, GETMOUSE
'' OR SCREEN. On linux-x86_64 a bare PRINT emits ESC[?1h ESC= ESC[6n and blocks
'' waiting for a cursor-position report; under a pty with no responder it hangs.
'' All output goes through TuiTerminal. RFC-0002 section 7.


